 "assigned_role": "mechanical",
 "description": "The balance loop's plant_mass is written as 200 g, the assembled-robot row R11.01, which the sheet says excludes batteries. It should be 365 g: 200 g plus the six-cell pack of 6 x 0.97 oz = 165 g. The pack rides in the body above the axle, so leaving it out drops 45 per cent of the mass whose gravity moment about the axle the motor torque must balance. The statics of the inverted pendulum no longer add up.",
